  "notes": "Typical of descriptions where the exact color is unclear, as in witness reports and lost-property inquiries.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {黒|くろ}っぽい⟦{服装|ふくそう}→服装：03594_fukusou⟧: dark clothing\n- {黒|くろ}っぽく⟦{変色|へんしょく}する→変色する：19529_henshokusuru⟧: to darken, to discolor\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{黒|くろ}い→黒い：00588_kuroi⟧: black — the plain color word\n- ⟦{白|しろ}っぽい→白っぽい：33949_shiroppoi⟧, ⟦{赤|あか}っぽい→赤っぽい：33950_akappoi⟧: whitish, reddish — the same pattern",
